# ── Dependencies ──
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ── Secrets & credentials (see .claude/rules/secrets-and-env.rules.md §6) ──
# Covers .env plus every per-environment file (.env.local/.env.dev/.env.qa/.env.prod);
# only the committed .env.example templates are exempt.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/secrets.json
**/credentials.json
**/storageState.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks

# Local JWKS / Cognito mock keypair — contains a private key, never commit
**/local-env/keypair.json

# ── Run artifacts ──
reports/
**/reports/
test-results/
**/test-results/
playwright-report/
**/playwright-report/
blob-report/
**/blob-report/
coverage/
**/coverage/
logs/
**/logs/
*.log

# ── OS / editor ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
